--
-- Housing: world data from sql/housing/ that the auto-updater never applied.
--
-- sql/housing/master/MASTER_housing_world.sql cannot be run on this DB: it deletes every spawn on maps
-- 2735/2736 (now provided by 2026_02_17_00_world.sql and 2026_03_03_01_world.sql) and reuses creature GUIDs
-- that other maps already own. This file takes only the non-spawn pieces and only adds what is missing:
--   * gameobject_template rows (cornerstones, house fixtures, doors incl. 575017/587318/602705) as
--     INSERT IGNORE, so templates that already exist are left untouched;
--   * the housing door spell/script binding from 2026_04_29_00_world.sql, re-applied for the new doors;
--   * spell_target_position for the tutorial and portal teleports into Founder's Point / Razorwind Shores;
--   * the tutorial quest chain links (world_housing_quest_chain.sql).
--
-- from sql/housing/world_housing_go_templates.sql

